            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani taparacu, tonyou ekile a aberu a ŋin, toŋaa ŋikekya a akai, ani elomari iŋes kiŋa elosi nen ecamit kiŋolik aberu keŋ ŋina pa eisitae eperi alokek akai, edolunito ŋakan keŋ nalapatu ŋina alokek a akai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok iŋes aberu keŋ tema, “Tonyou, oloto.” Nai mam ŋuna abu aberu ŋin toboŋok. Abu nai ekile ŋol todakak aberu keŋ losigirya, tolot lore keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli iŋes kai keŋ, tolemu ekileŋ, totubutubu akuwan a aberu keŋ, ŋarwa ŋatomon ka ŋaarei, kiyakiya nakwap a Isirael daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai iŋes ŋikilyok ŋulu eyakit iŋes tema, “Kiŋita Ŋisirael ŋakiro nu, ‘Etiyakinosi mono ŋakiro nu ŋinapei koloŋ ameun akoloŋit ŋina aponiata Ŋisirael anakwap a Ijipit a? Totamatamata ŋakiro nu, kirworo aloikiikoe kus, kiserata ikes.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
